{"Title":"An Act relative to coverage for chronic illness","BillNumber":"S784","DocketNumber":"SD2146","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"MCM0","Name":"Mark C. Montigny","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MCM0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-13T11:41:30.15"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"MCM0","Name":"Mark C. Montigny","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/MCM0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-13T11:41:30.15"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S784/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Montigny, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 784) of Mark C. Montigny for legislation relative to coverage for chronic illness.  Health Care Financing.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1.  Chapter 176J of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after section 14 the following new section:- \r\n\tSection 14A.  No carrier shall charge a co-payment or deductible for any prescriptions or devices that are prescribed by a physician and are necessary for the treatment or maintenance of a chronic disease, illness or condition. The department of public health shall adopt regulations further defining a chronic disease, illness or condition for purposes of this section. \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J24","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J24"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}